commended questions**\nAnswer these so I can narrow this down safely.\n\n**(1/4)**\nWhat changes have you noticed in daily life, for example poor sleep, low mood, irritability, loss of focus, panic, appetite changes, or trouble getting through normal tasks?\n\n**(2/4)**\nHow long has this been building up, and did it start gradually or after a specific event?\n\n**(3/4)**\nAre you also having physical symptoms such as headaches, chest tightness, palpitations, shortness of breath, stomach upset, trembling, or fatigue beyond your usual baseline?\n\n**(4/4)**\nAre you sleeping normally, and have you had any thoughts of harming yourself or feeling like you cannot cope safely?","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_08c5c20c9231f5440169e8ad95b8dc81918ba68888719c5843\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":23651,"output":451,"cacheRead":13824,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":37926,"cost":{"input":0.059127500000000006,"output":0.006765,"cacheRead":0.003456,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.06934850000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776856464179,"responseId":"resp_08c5c20c9231f5440169e8ad90644c8191b51b981189960303"}}
